{
  "_doc": "Offline eval cases for the Haiku fleet. Each case feeds a stubbed model response (what Haiku might say) through MC.ai.fleet.validate for a real engine job (candidates c0..cn captured from the seeded world), then optionally lands it via agent/aiRun. Template tokens in stub strings: {{title:N}} draft title of candidate N, {{num}} a number present in the context, {{cN.channel}} / {{cN.campaign}} target of candidate N. {\"$fields\":{channel,hook,body}} expands to a full 11-key copy fields object for that channel. expect keys: ok, error, verdicts (candidate:verdict list), titleBlank/whyBlank (decision indexes), summaryBlank, adjust (candidate -> param map) or adjustEmpty, confidences, insightTitles, insightCountMax, extraCount, extraMax, extraOriginalMax, land (dispatch the payload into the live run and check engine/ai labels).",
